- action(n1, "start screening staff process"): Hallucinates an initial step; the source explicitly states the process "begins by reviewing the support request" with no preceding action (SMC1, SMC3).
- action(n4, "You have completed this procedure"): Hallucinates a terminal step; the source states that once communication is finished, "the process comes to an end" immediately (SMC1, SMC3).
- actor(a_default, "Default", [i1, n1, n2, n3, n4, e1]): Fails to assign the responsible party explicitly identified in the source as "screening staff" (SMC7).